# Claim the Kingdom: "Landfall - Whenever a land you control enters, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control and
# a plan counter on this enchantment. When the fourth plan counter is put on this enchantment, sacrifice it. When you do,
# put an indestructible counter on target creature you control." Bot1's Forest on turn 1, then its Fabled Passage on turn 3
# and the Plains the Passage finds (two lands entering, two triggers) each put a +1/+1 counter on the Ornithopter and a
# plan counter on the enchantment; Bot2's Islands entering trigger nothing. The Plains played on turn 5 is the fourth:
# the enchantment is sacrificed and the reflexive ability (CR 603.12) puts an indestructible counter on the Ornithopter
# (CR 122.1b), now with four +1/+1 counters.

